<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Individual Inc.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Individual Inc.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co said research analyst Keith Benjamin raised his estimates on Individual Inc and reiterated a Buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Raised FY98 EPS estimate to $0.06 profit from a loss of $0.15.</p>
